@@table
## SQ-LOOT-13 | no Lexica Botania in a dungeon chest or the spawn bonus chest
@group A
@reviewed 2026-11-24
@commands `/loot spawn` `minecraft:chests/simple_dungeon` 30 times and `minecraft:chests/spawn_bonus_chest` 10 times at a cleared spot, then `/cdevtest items` there
@pass items rolled; no `botania:lexicon` among them; the other Botania inject items (mana bottle and the rest) still roll
@fails a lexicon shows: the jar predates 2026-11-21 (old `loot_config.json`), or the item became post-roll only (check `loot_index.json`)
> forceload add 3300 3300 3316 3316
> fill 3300 -60 3300 3310 -50 3310 minecraft:air
repeat 30
> loot spawn 3305 -58 3305 loot minecraft:chests/simple_dungeon
end
repeat 10
> loot spawn 3305 -58 3305 loot minecraft:chests/spawn_bonus_chest
end
sleep 2
> cdevtest items 3305 -58 3305 6
waitlog verb=items 30
expect verb=items .*stacks=[1-9]
reject verb=items .*botania:lexicon
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|\[cdevtest\] .*(done=0|error=))
look the item list holds dungeon and spawn bonus chest loot, Botania mana bottles may show, no lexicon
